静かな場所"},{"label":"好きな食べ物","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23487","value":"郷土鍋（きりたんぽ鍋、せんべい汁、あんこう鍋etc）"},{"label":"嫌いなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23487","value":"オカルト"},{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23487","value":"2年"},{"label":"星座","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23487","value":"みずがめ座"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23487","value":"勉強"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23487","value":"入浴"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/937ceed0733f59ec828a0350d540deeaf944b37a068e3060831b3c2cb754f26f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d7a5c880db1d7766049ef32817af7175b726c806b9ce0d4f4b8d38019a57737.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞沢渓","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:85352:23487:5741:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17267","characterName":"橘 恵理加","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"23488","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"85352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2401"],"vndbCharacterId":"c17267"},"originalCharacterName":"橘 恵理加","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Burning fallen leaves in bonfires"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Skills: Memorizing Hyakunin Isshu"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Everything Japanese"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Anything Western"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Liked food: Red bean soup, matcha"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hated food: Coffee"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Honoka's coworker and the Japanese History teacher. She acts completely like a person from the past and looks younger than she is. Due to her younger looks, the students call her different forms of \"loli\", which is one way to anger her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17267"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほのかの同僚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"通称、ろりか。担当は日本史。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目はロリ、頭脳はババア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目がロリなせいか、学生たちからは『ろりかちゃん』などと呼ばれ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり敬われていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"語尾に『じゃ』をつけて話すため『ジャロリ』もしくは『邪ロリ』と呼ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の宿直室を自分好みの和室に改造し住んでいるので「恋々学園の座敷わらし」と言われることも。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2401","sourceWorkId":"19647","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほのかの同僚。 担当は日本史。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目はロリ、頭脳はババア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目がロリなせいか、学生たちからは “ろりかちゃん” などと呼ばれ、あまり敬われていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"語尾に 「じゃ」 をつけて話すため “ジャロリ”、もしくは “邪ロリ” とも呼ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の宿直室を自分好みの和室に改造し住んでいるので、“恋々学園の座敷わらし” と言われることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「抹茶は美味しいのぅ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23488"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23488","value":"和風なもの"},{"label":"好きな食べ物","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23488","value":"白玉クリームぜんざい、抹茶"},{"label":"嫌いなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23488","value":"洋風なもの"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23488","value":"百人一首"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23488","value":"落ち葉で焚き火"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/061ade15064cc6c48517ae5a669e55477c459f952c5886c01e7189a6d12c6544.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/9528a1bc3f23ffbe1067b5df33528bf118ea283adafa7968026b08ada1568c51.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深田愛衣","creatorId":"vndb:s607","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s607","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s607","name":"深田 愛衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:85352:23488:6509:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17268","characterName":"山中 翔太郎","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"187523","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"85352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2402"],"vndbCharacterId":"c17268"},"originalCharacterName":"山中 翔太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"506"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Training"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Skills: Making rice balls"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Puns, adventures, love"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: People coming down the stairs (and vice versa)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite food: Rice"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hated food: Mud dumpling (Chinami once forced him to taste this)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of the story. He loves cooking and has high physical abilities, but hates and can't study nor take his studies seriously. Shotarou is well-known in the academy for causing the most incidents, but to most people he is a good guy. Shotarou has only one goal in his life and this is why he came to Renren Academy: to find himself a girlfriend."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17268"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"曲がったことが大嫌い勉強はできないが身体能力は高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園内で数々の事件を起こしたため問題児扱いされているも、根はいい奴なので、学生たちからの人望はある"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一時期塞ぎこんでいた義妹（くるみ）を励ますためバカなように振舞っていたら、本当にバカになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのまま成長し恋人も欲しいので恋々学園に入り、周りにカップル限定の物ばかりあるので、自分もやはり彼女が欲しいと再確認する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2402","sourceWorkId":"19647","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"曲がったことが大嫌い勉強はできないが身体能力は高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園内で数々の事件を起こしたため問題児扱いされているも、根はいい奴なので、学生たちからの人望はある"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一時期塞ぎこんでいた義妹（くるみ）を励ますためバカなように振舞っていたら、本当にバカになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのまま成長し恋人も欲しいので恋々学園に入り、周りにカップル限定の物ばかりあるので、自分もやはり彼女が欲しいと再確認する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"187523"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be4ee5147655259bd6f3817d74489b2085ed6472e735f546cec9cf538cf0ce47.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8d11c6f34672a951dd3d4f227810aaaf408e8b3f30af24d0121b353d9802ecad.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"古河徹人","creatorId":"vndb:s299","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s299","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s299","name":"古河 徹人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:85352:187523:6265:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17269","characterName":"クルム 杉山 しのぶ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"23489","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"85352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2403"],"vndbCharacterId":"c17269"},"originalCharacterName":"クルム 杉山 しのぶ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chinami's loyal maid. Kurumu was born into a family dedicated to serving the Kamiwazumi house, and has been around Chinami ever since she was a child. Perfect in everything, except for the fact that she can't stand insects."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17269"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"千菜美の専属メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主をバカと認めていて、あまり敬ってはいないように見せるも、誰よりも千菜美のことを信頼している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全てのことを完璧にこなすが虫が苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼き頃のある日、千菜美家の壷が割れてしまい、クルムが疑われてしまうも、千菜美が全力でかばってくれた。後日濡れ衣は晴れ、それがきっかけで、千菜美を敬愛する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみにクルムは千菜美がつけたあだ名。カッコ良さそうだからというだけの理由。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも、しのぶは気に入っていて、クルムと呼ばれるのに愛情を感じている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2403","sourceWorkId":"19647","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"千菜美の専属メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々神和住家のメイドを務める家系に生まれ、ずっと千菜美と共に過ごしているので仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主をバカと認めていて、あまり敬っていないように見せるも、誰よりも千菜美のことを信頼している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すべてのことを完璧にこなすが、虫が苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに “クルム” は千菜美が付けたあだ名。 カッコ良さそうだからというだけの理由。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも しのぶは気に入っていて、クルムと呼ばれることに愛着を感じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お嬢様って本当にバカですね」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23489"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f788c26ba60fbea6485ad22bd3f0e143f5ca634f387788825cdccff0a00bd889.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/1065fca0992ff5dd15546db5b5a7f0e9e75d9bc169197f79bc330078bd266fa8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"吉田愛理","creatorId":"vndb:s757","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s757","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s757","name":"吉田 愛理","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:85352:23489:6037:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17270","characterName":"藤原 春希","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"23490","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"85352"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2404"],"vndbCharacterId":"c17270"},"originalCharacterName":"藤原 春希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kurumi's classmate and the secretary of student council. A total bookworm to the point where she won't stop whenever she starts talking about books. Haruki is a bit docile, but strong to the core, and thinks that studying is more important than love."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17270"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"くるみのクラスメイトで学生会書記、三度の飯より読書が好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おとなしい、が言いたい事はいう芯が強いタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は口数が少ない方だが本の話になると増水した川のごとく止まらない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっぱいも大きいので魅力的（ロリ巨乳的な意味）なのだが本の話題でしかほとんど会話が出来ないため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男子とはなかなか噛み合わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼氏が出来ないことを気にしていたところで、愛の「恋愛より勉学が大事よ！」という言葉に感銘を受け、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生会の書記に立候補した。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2404","sourceWorkId":"19647","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"くるみのクラスメイトで学生会書記。 三度の飯より読書が好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おとなしいが、言いたいことは言う芯が強いタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は口数が少ないほうだが、本の話になると増水した川のごとく止まらない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっぱいも大きく魅力的なのだが、本の話題でしかほとんど会話が出来ないため、男子とはなかなか噛み合わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼氏ができないことを気にしていたところ、愛の 「恋愛より勉学が大事よ！」 という言葉に感銘を受け、学生会の書記に立候補した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ひょっとしてそれはギャグで言ってるんですか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23490"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/344883f4018c79905ea241fb28a2f09955dea9127075219945e41e7136424b62.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c40d5e37a02358b8f311f90a2b9b01fd107dd7f640c37a098f7cb2aa5bf8ec5e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"やなせなつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s365","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s365","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s365","name":"やなせ なつみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:85352:23490:4714:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17271","characterName":"村雲 龍二","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["2405"],"vndbCharacterId":"c17271"},"originalCharacterName":"村雲 龍二","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shotarou's best friend, they've been friends ever since they entered high school on the first day. Compared to Shotarou, he takes his studies seriously, is regarded as the \"academy's hot guy\", and is better at sports than him. He dislikes people who judge others based on their looks."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17271"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"翔太郎の親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翔太郎とは恋々学園入学からの付き合い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績も優秀で運動神経も翔太郎には劣るも良く、礼儀正しくて真面目な優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人を見た目で判断せず、中身で判断する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、念願の彼女をゲットできるも、かなり個性的な外見で、男たちからは恨まれるどころか尊敬されていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、そのことを馬鹿にする者も多かった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな中、翔太郎だけは本気で祝福をし、馬鹿にしている男たちを一蹴する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この事と、告白する勇気をくれた『黄昏のバンジージャンプ事件』がきっかけで、翔太郎と熱い友情で結ばれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2405","sourceWorkId":"19647","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8cfcd190c9020897cb6f382ea2e1b005ad8b7f68fa422ddf2b3157e7a5bff1c7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/964271bcca85bf703448660841bff60e3fde542e68bc10beda92e2a1dc3f33dd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葵 海人","creatorId":"vndb:s4264","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4264","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4264","name":"葵 海人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:55427","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17272","characterName":"佐藤 修造","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["2406"],"vndbCharacterId":"c17272"},"originalCharacterName":"佐藤 修造","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shotarou's love master and the one who taught him the road of love he should walk on. He lives usually in parks and appears to be both homeless and unemployed, not to mention \"Ryuuzaki Kakeru\" is not his real name. Also known as the \"world's strongest virgin\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17272"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称、恋愛の達人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は公園に住んでいるいわゆるホームレス（職業不明）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある時翔太郎と出会いその強さ故に弟子入りを志願される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若き頃は山篭りなどをして己を磨いていたため、武術には長けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪い人物ではないのだが、恋愛に関しては素人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、自分を慕う翔太郎の前では切り出せず、見当違いの助言をしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翔太郎はそれを真に受け実行してしまうので、バカに拍車がかかる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2406","sourceWorkId":"19647","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f3c7a4b0afc78c7df811bec8da84c465e3576046160f83cc586cc8df85c097b2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/31fd6c183cc67670619b64c37087736c01e5f3f5f5f672a729002b0654ff5d0a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深川 緑","creatorId":"vndb:s5570","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5570","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5570","name"